Decorative parametric lampshades, printed in vase mode one perimeter layer at a
time. The geometry helper and the adapter mounting helpers plus the six shade
shapes the catalog exposes are vendored verbatim from the pinned commit; the
remaining shades, the feet and adaptor parts, the render scripts and the image
assets are not vendored.

